{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜结构图\n箭头与标签表示持有、调用和只读数据交付；CMC 唯一持请求／FAILED、移动时间与胶囊执行。\n[[Movement/结构|结构文档]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|流程图]] · [[计划蓝图|模块入口]]\n2026-10-05：Source 6b7361d；Gate91 编译 exit0，必要烟3 Success／1 Fail。七旧DA已退役；正式Run／攻击位移／网络及AnimBP相位仍开放。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2630,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero／Input 来源接口\nInput 唯一发行 Session／Request／Fact 与真实 Press／Held／Release。\nHero 转交原资源：Bind／Consume／Invalidate → CMC；Input_Move 提交轴值，ForceWalk 提交请求。\n轴值／零Acceleration不证明来源或释放；Hero1等待原Owner Ready并查询Source仍Held后一次准入。\n[[Input/结构|来源职责]] · [[Character/结构|装配职责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMovementSet｜数值规则\nValidateMovementSet(Error) → 数值合法性；SetMovementSet(Set,Error) → accepted配置，GetMovementSet只读实际结果。\n保持阈值、混合／停止／转身与物理参数；显式曲线false才固定Walk／Run速度。\n七废弃Profile字段仅序列化／迁移兼容；实际默认引用已null，七DA已删除，十九参数位模式保持。\n[[Movement/结构#正式 MovementSet 分发与只读查询|分发与校验]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n唯一请求／FAILED、Gait、hold、WalkRunBlendAlpha、motion time／cycle、TurnBack阶段及胶囊执行。\nPublishLocomotionSourceBinding(Binding,Error) → 接收原身份／代际快照；bool不代表源可执行。\nRetireLocomotionSourceBinding(原Producer,原配置代际) → 仅退原发布／Locomotion，不撤后继或GA。\nBefore → TryUpdateLocomotion：普通段求值成功Commit；Stop／TurnBack Stage(tick,Candidate,error)捕获原资源，不预支整帧。\nPrepare(Source,sim,tick,out,error) → 核对原group／Origin／Input并求实际区间；Consume(Prepared)同结果一次提交。\nGetMaxSpeed／PhysicsRotation／native Physics执行；曲线缺／坏源明确失败，无固定速度替代。\nReset／EndPlay／回放退出释放自己的原引用。\n[[Movement/结构#本地 CurveRMS 原资源与实际区间|Stage／Prepare／Consume]]",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 660,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sampler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOLocomotionSourceBinding｜不可变来源\nAnimation定义共享DTO；原Producer／Character／Mesh弱身份，生命周期／配置代际、Available／Missing／Invalid／Stale及错误。\n原Sequence／BlendSpace强引用、RouteKey、PlayLength、SequenceRateScale；实际BS SampleIndex／Value／SampleRateScale与loop语义。\n无曲线副本、播放时钟、姿态历史、求值速度或准入；强引用随当前绑定／SavedMove／Origin／Input原生命周期释放。\n[[Movement/结构#动画唯一来源与发布生命周期|输入与有效期]]",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rms",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FRootMotionSource_GGYGOCurve\nStop／TurnBack原生资源，持原Origin／只读Prepared。\nnative PrepareRootMotion(sim,tick) → 原CMC Prepare／Consume → 安装Override速度、native时间／结束状态。\n实时t0=OriginMotion+(SourceTime−OriginSource)，t1=t0+sim；端点速度×sim/tick，非平移积分。\nStop结束：正sim且原Sample.Speed恰为0（RootMotionScale前）；正小值／Scale=0不提前结束，TurnBack按阶段。\nClone保原引用；Matches／Update拒绝本地Origin不符。NetSerialize wire保持，加载清本地引用；导入Origin未认证。\n旧贡献只退自己，独立Action沿原仲裁。",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 470,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FSavedMove_GGYGO／MoveData／Response\nSetMoveFor → 原语义、SourceBinding、输入checkpoint、Owner nonce／generation。\nPostUpdate → 保原Input／Prepared；PostUpdate_Replay不覆盖；来源变化／有关RMS限制合并。\nPrepMoveFor在native Super前BeginReplay原记录／SavedRootMotion；Prepared存在却缺原native source明确拒绝。\nauthority按自身Candidate.MotionTime重算实际区间；旧Prepared仅供区间元信息，禁止直接提交旧候选／速度。\nClear／EndReplay清自身引用，不重开FAILED或补新Ready。\nOwner v2原receipt／ACK／correction完整返回后Ready；本地原绑定不证明网络导入。\n[[Movement/结构#SavedMove 原绑定与权威校正|回放契约]]",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame／现有 AnimBP\nCapture提交后的Gait、WalkRunBlendAlpha、StopMotionType、TurnBack等只读事实。\nABP_Pyrios同一BS：X=0 Walk／1 Run；旧StateMemory.GaitBlendY兼容，StopValue映射0／1／2。\n原EnterMove／WalkRun／Stop／TurnBack拓扑保留；walkRun字典键保原资产兼容。\nPlayer／Evaluator相位未迁移，不承诺同钟／无脚滑；轴显示名保存未验。\n[[Animation/结构|表现职责]]",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前边界与架构核对\n原动画是Locomotion唯一编辑源；旧LocomotionMotionProfile／GetProfileForMotion／AnimCurveSampler只供历史兼容工具／测试。MovementSet仅数值；独立ActionMotionProfile保持业务含义。\nAnimation发布身份／元信息，CMC独占时间／请求／执行，纯求值无状态，RMS／SavedMove仅保原资源及派生快照；无第二Tick／执行链／隐式兜底，清理不撤后继。\nGate91：RawAndScaled／StrictValidation／AuthorityAndMapping Success；FailedRequestRecovery仅原两Error且请求3完成，仍Fail。校正0.416／292／原Prepared不可变通过。\n两Stop三DirX值保存／冷读；raw骨键／Channel未验。七DA实际删、Set七null／十九参数保持、八包备份、冷Registry缺席、dirty=[]；GA资产未改。\n正式物理首W／Run／ABP、生产攻击位移、完整网络／导入Origin未验。Gadge／GA_Dodge占位，后续统一GAS。\n[[Movement/结构#验收、退役与剩余边界|实际证据与历史失败]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 2630,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement-test-map",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## L_Movement_Test｜历史运行入口\n/Game/Map/L_Movement_Test：阻挡地面、PlayerStart、原Experience／PawnData装配；地图不发行移动资格。\n历史38秒／4513帧接地、Run／TurnBack属于新来源门禁前，不能证明当前Run。\n[[Movement/移动测试关卡|配置与历史证据]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-profile",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## UGGYGOActionMotionProfile\n独立业务累计位移：TranslationCurve、Duration、TranslationScale，cm／秒／Mesh Component空间，首帧0。\nValidateMotion → 配置成功／定位失败；不属于七动画曲线副本，本轮未改／未删。\nGA／角色资产配置动作与速率。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|独立接口与资产状态]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-executor",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## CMC 显式动作接口\nGA → BeginActionMotion(Profile,PlayRate) → 校验／挂唯一Action RMS，返回精确Handle。\nEndActionMotion(Handle) → 只移除原资源；自然结束／离地释放。\nAction在场抑制Locomotion／自动旋转；MovementSet重置不结束Action。\nPlayerCombo仍Montage-only，未接BeginActionMotion／CantMove；生产攻击位移未关闭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-rms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FRootMotionSource_GGYGOActionCurve\n原native Prepare以累计轨迹差分、入口Mesh基准输出世界Override速度；CMC唯一执行胶囊／碰撞。\nGA管理精确资源Handle与能力生命周期，Animation管理Montage／窗口。\n参数与资产沿原序列化／引用清理契约。\n[[Movement/GGYGO_流程_动作曲线执行.canvas|动作流程]] · [[Movement/动作曲线执行|验证边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "locomotion-evaluation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GGYGOLocomotionEvaluation｜纯求值\nValidateSource／ValidateBinding → 原资产身份／长度／速率／loop／必需运行曲线合格。\nEvaluateSingleInterval(Source,t0,t1,Scale,out,error) → 端点Speed／Dir、区间Yaw、缩放速度向量；原EvaluateCurveData，秒×SequenceRateScale。\nEvaluateWalkRunInterval(Binding,cycle,dt,alpha,Scale,out,error) → 原BS GetSamplesFromBlendInput权重／GetAnimationLengthFromSampleData周期；各源先求值，再混合速度向量与Yaw。\n零／微小正值／Scale=0／向量抵消合法；缺方向、负／非有限明确失败且Reset输出。\n无缓存／日志／状态／时钟；Scale不缩放Yaw。\n原生纯查询不等于最终AnimGraph滤波／marker／姿态相位。\n[[Movement/结构#纯求值与普通移动提交|算法与提交]]",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 530,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "input-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一 CMC｜原事实消费与 FAILED\nConsumeMovementInputFact(Binding,Fact,Error) → 完整原身份／Mode／Proof／Event校验；Recorded／Duplicate／Stale／Rejected。\nCold一次窗首Started在配置／执行失败前耗尽；恢复需真实Release→Neutral→新Press。\n完整同Event才Duplicate且不重执行；旧Request高Event仍Stale，不污染水位；零Acceleration不证明释放。\n纯求值Reject(originalSerial,error)／RMS Report(Origin,error) → Fail原请求。无号不补请求、旧源不失败后继。\n配置／Reset／同Started／Ready不自动重试。\n[[Input/结构|物理权威]] · [[Movement/结构#原请求失败与 Input 消费|消费契约]]",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-subscription",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一 CMC｜ASC 身份订阅\nBeginPlay Cache → PrepareLocalAbilitySystemSubscription原Extension一次注册；持原Handle／opaque派生缓存。\nReady验证原Owner／PublishedContext，新opaque才Reset；同Ready／Refreshed不Reset，晚Released不清后继。\nGetReadyLocalAbilitySystemComponent const → CantMove查询。\nRelease只注销原Handle，不清FAILED／GA；EndPlay先封闭执行及原CurveRMS／回放，再清自身订阅。\n已编译，独立动态未验。\n[[Character/结构|发布源]] · [[Movement/结构#本地 ASC 身份订阅|资源清理]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "native-owner-sync",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 同一 CMC｜原生 Owner 同步\nGetMovementOwnerSyncScope(out,error) → 活原Scope；非运动许可。\nSubscribe(Scope,callback,outObserver,error) → 先安装Observer再同步Replay；bool仅曾安装，回调后重验。\nUnsubscribe(原Observer,reason,error) → 精确取消，含在途Invalidated未调用项。\n唯一Scope／nonce／server generation来自原Pawn／PC／连接／Driver生命周期。\nOwner v2原move → native receipt → ACK／correction完整返回后Ready；不补旧move。\nM3／Hero1一次TryAdmit须原资源匹配并Source仍Held；Ready不重开FAILED或合成Press。\n已编译；正式物理输入／完整网络未验，EndPlay封闭原入口后退休原范围。\n[[Movement/结构#原生移动 Owner 同步|接口与生命周期]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-publisher",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Animation｜原来源发布者\nUGGYGOAnimInstanceBase原Initialize／Update／Uninitialize观察原Owner／Mesh／主Producer／配置，发布或退休原代际。\nUZZZAnimInstance从FZZZAnimSet解析五原非循环Sequence＋walkRun实际BS样本；缺／坏源明确Missing／Invalid。\n无曲线拷贝／移动时钟／速度或准入；原强资产引用随原绑定释放。\n固定模式无resolver为正常可选能力缺席；曲线请求必须合格。\n[[Animation/结构|Animation职责]] · [[Movement/结构#动画唯一来源与发布生命周期|跨模块入口]]"
    }
  ],
